function tirePanelHTML(){const condition=tireCondition(),profile=tireProfile(condition),cost=tireReplacementCost(),speed=effectiveTruckSpeed();return'<section class="tire-panel '+profile.className+'"><header><div><span>CONDIÇÃO DOS PNEUS</span><b>'+condition.toFixed(1).replace('.',',')+'%</b></div><strong>'+profile.label+'</strong></header><div class="tire-meter"><i style="width:'+condition+'%"></i></div><p>Velocidade atual: <b>'+speed.toFixed(1).replace('.',',')+' km/h</b> · desgaste médio de 1% a cada 100 km.</p><div class="tire-rules"><small>90–100%: +20%</small><small>80–89%: +10%</small><small>40–79%: normal</small><small>20–39%: −10%</small><small>1–19%: −30%</small><small>0%: bloqueado</small></div><button type="button" data-replace-tires '+(state.trip?'disabled':'')+'>TROCAR PNEUS · '+money(cost)+'</button></section>'}
function replaceTires(){if(state.trip){toast('Conclua a viagem antes de trocar os pneus.');return}const condition=tireCondition(),cost=tireReplacementCost();if(condition>=100){toast('Os pneus já estão novos.');return}if(state.balance<cost){toast('Saldo insuficiente. A troca custa '+money(cost)+'.');return}state.balance-=cost;state.tires={tia:100,agrale8500:100,mercedes710:100,volkswagen8150:100,...(state.tires||{})};state.tires[state.truck]=100;addLedger('debit',cost,'Troca de pneus',currentTruck().name+' · jogo novo de pneus.',Date.now(),'tires-'+Date.now());save();toast('Pneus novos instalados. Bônus de velocidade ativado.');truckPageV2()}
const fuelNumber=value=>Number.isFinite(Number(value))?Number(value):0;
function ensureFuel(){if(!state)return;const existing=state.fuel&&typeof state.fuel==='object'?{...state.fuel}:{};if((Number(state.fuelVersion)||0)<2){if(existing.tia!=null)existing.tia=Math.max(0,Math.min(120,fuelNumber(existing.tia)/70*120));state.fuelVersion=2}if((Number(state.fuelVersion)||0)<3){if(existing.tia!=null)existing.tia=Math.max(0,Math.min(100,fuelNumber(existing.tia)/120*100));state.fuelVersion=3}state.fuel={};Object.entries(truckCatalog).forEach(([id,truck])=>{const value=existing[id];state.fuel[id]=Math.max(0,Math.min(truck.fuelCapacity,value==null?truck.fuelCapacity:fuelNumber(value)))})}
function fuelLevel(truckId=state?.truck||'tia'){ensureFuel();return state?state.fuel[truckId]:truckCatalog[truckId].fuelCapacity}
function fuelLitersFor(km,truck=currentTruck()){return Math.round(Number(km)/truck.kmPerLiter*100)/100}
function fuelCostFor(km,truck=currentTruck()){return Math.round(fuelLitersFor(km,truck)*DIESEL_PRICE*100)/100}
function canFuelTrip(km,truck=currentTruck()){return fuelLevel()+.001>=fuelLitersFor(km,truck)}
function consumeFuel(km,truckId=state.truck){ensureFuel();const truck=truckCatalog[truckId],used=fuelLitersFor(km,truck);state.fuel[truckId]=Math.max(0,Math.round((fuelLevel(truckId)-used)*100)/100);return used}function updateTripFuel(forceComplete=false){if(!state?.trip)return false;if(state.trip.truckOnTrain)return false;ensureFuel();const trip=state.trip,truckId=trip.truckId||state.truck,truck=truckCatalog[truckId]||currentTruck(),planned=Number(trip.fuelPlanned)||fuelLitersFor(trip.totalKm,truck);if(!Number.isFinite(Number(trip.fuelStart))){const legacyCharged=Number(trip.fuelUsed)>0&&!trip.fuelPlanned;trip.fuelStart=Math.min(truck.fuelCapacity,fuelLevel(truckId)+(legacyCharged?planned:0));trip.fuelPlanned=planned}const status=tripStatus(),timePct=forceComplete?1:(status?.pct||0),fuelLimit=planned>0?Math.min(1,Math.max(0,Number(trip.fuelStart)/planned)):1,pct=forceComplete?1:Math.min(timePct,fuelLimit),used=Math.round(planned*pct*100)/100,next=Math.max(0,Math.round((Number(trip.fuelStart)-used)*100)/100),justStopped=!forceComplete&&!trip.pausedAt&&fuelLimit<1&&timePct>=fuelLimit,changed=justStopped||Math.abs(next-fuelLevel(truckId))>=.01||Math.abs(used-(Number(trip.fuelUsed)||0))>=.01;state.fuel[truckId]=next;trip.fuelUsed=used;trip.fuelPlanned=planned;if(justStopped){trip.durationMs=Number(trip.durationMs)||trip.end-trip.start;trip.pausedAt=Date.now();trip.pausedProgress=fuelLimit;state.savedAt=Date.now();localStorage.setItem(key(),JSON.stringify(state));syncProgress();toast('O caminhão ficou sem combustível e parou. Abasteça para continuar a viagem.')}updateTopFuel();return changed}
function fuelPanelHTML(){const truck=currentTruck(),level=fuelLevel(),capacity=truck.fuelCapacity,missing=Math.max(0,capacity-level),cost=Math.round(missing*DIESEL_PRICE*100)/100,pct=capacity?level/capacity*100:0;return'<section class="fuel-panel '+(pct<=20?'critical':'')+'"><header><div><span>TANQUE DE DIESEL S10</span><b>'+level.toFixed(1).replace('.',',')+' L <small>/ '+capacity+' L</small></b></div><strong>'+Math.round(pct)+'%</strong></header><div class="fuel-meter"><i style="width:'+pct+'%"></i></div><p>Consumo médio: <b>'+truck.kmPerLiter.toFixed(1).replace('.',',')+' km/L</b> · preço no jogo: <b>'+money(DIESEL_PRICE)+'/L</b> · média nacional ANP de 23–29/08/2026.</p><div class="fuel-data"><small>AUTONOMIA COM O TANQUE ATUAL<b>'+Math.floor(level*truck.kmPerLiter)+' km</b></small><small>PARA COMPLETAR O TANQUE<b>'+missing.toFixed(1).replace('.',',')+' L · '+money(cost)+'</b></small></div><button type="button" data-refuel '+(missing<.01?'disabled':'')+'>'+(missing<.01?'TANQUE CHEIO':'COMPLETAR TANQUE · '+money(cost))+'</button></section>'}
function refuelTruck(){if(state.trip)updateTripFuel();const truck=currentTruck(),missing=Math.max(0,truck.fuelCapacity-fuelLevel()),cost=Math.round(missing*DIESEL_PRICE*100)/100;if(missing<.01){toast('O tanque já está cheio.');return}if(state.balance<cost){toast('Saldo insuficiente. O abastecimento completo custa '+money(cost)+'.');return}state.balance-=cost;state.fuel[state.truck]=truck.fuelCapacity;if(state.trip){const trip=state.trip;trip.fuelStart=truck.fuelCapacity+(Number(trip.fuelUsed)||0);trip.refueledDuringTrip=true;if(trip.pausedAt){const duration=Number(trip.durationMs)||trip.end-trip.start,pct=Math.min(1,Math.max(0,Number(trip.pausedProgress)||0)),now=Date.now();trip.start=now-duration*pct;trip.end=trip.start+duration;delete trip.pausedAt;delete trip.pausedProgress}}addLedger('debit',cost,'Abastecimento de diesel S10',truck.name+' · '+missing.toFixed(1).replace('.',',')+' litros a '+money(DIESEL_PRICE)+'/L.'+(state.trip?' · abastecimento durante a viagem.':''),Date.now(),'fuel-'+Date.now());save();toast('Tanque abastecido com '+missing.toFixed(1).replace('.',',')+' litros'+(state.trip?' durante a viagem.':'.'));truckPageV2()}
